---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /writing/
title: Field notes — Sarthak Bichhawa
desc: "Notes from production: shipping GenAI in enterprise, building ML platforms other teams stand on, and evaluating autonomous agents."
ogImage: /og/writing.png
ogImageAlt: "Field notes — notes from production, where the demos go to die"
---
<section class="section-pad page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">‹ <a href="/">The brief</a></nav>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="sec-mark">§05 — Field notes</div>
      <h1 class="sec-title">Notes from production, <em>where the demos go to die.</em></h1>
      <p class="sec-sub">
        The gap between the prototype that wows a leadership review and the
        system that survives real engineers trying to break it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="writing-list">
      {%- for w in facts.writing %}
      {%- if w.url %}
      <a href="{{ w.url }}" class="write-row panel reveal">
        <div class="write-when">{{ w.date | humanDate }}</div>
        <div class="write-title">{{ w.title }}</div>
        <span class="write-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
        </span>
      </a>
      {%- else %}
      <div class="write-row pending panel reveal">
        <div class="write-when">in queue</div>
        <div class="write-title">{{ w.title }}</div>
        <span class="write-status">{{ w.status }}</span>
      </div>
      {%- endif %}
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
